    "description": "This is just the milestone for the next release.\r\nThere is no consent about the version or the date.\r\n\r\nMajor Features of release 0.5\r\n- broadcast variables\r\n- new java api\r\n- improved hadoop compatibility\r\n- collection data source\r\n- many bugfixes and improvements\r\n\r\n0.5-rc1 is planned for 7. March.\r\n",
